{
  "_comment": "For each fixture: either `expectClean` (the report's first line must be `No findings.`) or a list of planted problems. A planted problem passes when the report mentions at least one of its `anyOf` strings (case-insensitive). Strings are field names or phrases from the fixture, so the check is that the skill FOUND the line, not how it worded the finding.",
